{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 93, "end_sec": 527.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000093", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 519.16, "text": "凡是把財富建立在別人的先行上、漢水上沒有好下場的!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 94, "end_sec": 531.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000094", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 527.16, "text": "當他們說了話的時候我心裡想你走著看!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 95, "end_sec": 538.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000095", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 531.16, "text": "你走著看!七哥人生不是多長!也活了五十多年了!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 96, "end_sec": 544.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000096", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 538.16, "text": "我經歷過最多的事情!不用相信!也不用依靠什麼惡意惡報、善惡善報!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 97, "end_sec": 549.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000097", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 544.16, "text": "根本不用在乎!一定要相信!跟暴徒、暴徒說!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 98, "end_sec": 554.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000098", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 549.16, "text": "他做了壞事一定會是壞節目!英國暴徒一點都不用懷疑!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 99, "end_sec": 563.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000099", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 554.16, "text": "只有新中國聯邦!風水多好!愛戰友吧!真的愛戰友!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 100, "end_sec": 569.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000100", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 563.16, "text": "咱們太多戰友!太偉大了!從昨天到今天我們幾十個戰友出來啊!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 101, "end_sec": 577.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000101", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 569.16, "text": "喜避就人!無描有弊!何其偉大!和這些垃圾的相比!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 102, "end_sec": 583.16, "id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000102", "live_id": "LIVE_20220811_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 577.16, "text": "我們太幸福了!行李天直播吧!別不如我小火來一堆!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20220811_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
